# Rust Radar — Niche Tech News Aggregator

A full implementation of the Rust Radar project: a HN-style news aggregator built for the Rust ecosystem, with a premium UI/UX, Python scraper, and Discord/Slack notification system.

---

## Design System (UI/UX Pro Max Applied)

- **Product type**: Developer tool / content aggregator
- **Style**: Dark-mode-first glassmorphism with subtle neon accents; minimalist HN spirit but premium feel
- **Color palette**: Deep navy (#0D1117) background → Rust orange (#E8613A / #FF6B35) primary → Electric amber (#FFB347) secondary → Slate (#8B949E) muted text
- **Typography**: Inter (body) + JetBrains Mono (code/numbers) from Google Fonts
- **Animations**: 150–300ms transitions, hover lifts, score bar animations
- **Layout**: Mobile-first, max-width 900px centered, systematic 8px spacing

---

## Project Structure

```
Niche Tech News Aggregator/
├── site/
│   ├── index.html          # Premium HN-style frontend
│   ├── style.css           # Full design system CSS
│   ├── app.js              # Data loading + rendering + search/filter
│   └── data.json           # Generated by scraper (sample included)
├── scraper/
│   ├── config.py           # RSS sources, HN query, weights
│   ├── scrape.py           # Main scraper: RSS + HN Algolia → data.json
│   └── requirements.txt    # feedparser, requests
├── notify/
│   ├── post_digest.py             # One-shot webhook: Discord + Slack top-3
│   ├── discord_bot_persistent.py  # Always-on bot with APScheduler
│   └── requirements-bot.txt       # discord.py, APScheduler, pytz, requests
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       ├── hourly-scrape.yml      # Scrape + commit data.json every hour
│       └── daily-digest.yml       # Post top-3 digest daily at 08:00 UTC
└── README.md               # Full setup guide
```

