## Proposed Changes

### [NEW] `site/data.json`
Sample data file with 10 realistic Rust news items for immediate demo.

### [NEW] `site/index.html`
- Premium dark glassmorphism design
- Live search/filter bar
- Category filters (RSS / HN / All)
- Story cards with: rank number, heat bar, title, domain tag, score, age, source badge
- Auto-refresh indicator (shows last updated time)
- Header: Rust Radar logo + tagline + stats

### [NEW] `site/style.css`
Full design system:
- CSS custom properties (color tokens, spacing scale, font scale)
- Glassmorphism card styles
- Animated heat meter
- Hover effects (lift + glow)
- Responsive layout

### [NEW] `site/app.js`
- Fetch data.json (with CORS-friendly approach)
- Render story list with rank, score, heat bar
- Live search
- Filter by source (RSS / HN / All)
- Relative time formatting
- Domain extraction from URL

### [NEW] `scraper/config.py`
Rust-specific RSS sources + weights + HN query

### [NEW] `scraper/scrape.py`
- Fetches all RSS feeds (feedparser)
- Queries HN Algolia API
- Deduplicates by URL
- Scores: RSS (freshness decay × weight), HN (points + freshness bonus)
- Outputs site/data.json

### [NEW] `scraper/requirements.txt`
feedparser, requests

### [NEW] `notify/post_digest.py`
One-shot: reads data.json, posts top 3 to Discord webhook + Slack webhook

### [NEW] `notify/discord_bot_persistent.py`
Always-on bot: APScheduler daily post at configured timezone

### [NEW] `notify/requirements-bot.txt`
discord.py, APScheduler, pytz, requests

### [NEW] `.github/workflows/hourly-scrape.yml`
GitHub Actions: hourly cron, runs scrape.py, commits data.json

### [NEW] `.github/workflows/daily-digest.yml`
GitHub Actions: daily 08:00 UTC, runs post_digest.py

### [NEW] `README.md`
Full documentation

