## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Open `site/index.html` via `python -m http.server` inside `site/` — verify premium UI renders correctly
2. Run `pip install -r scraper/requirements.txt && python scraper/scrape.py` — verify data.json is written
3. Check that search/filter works in the browser
4. Verify responsive layout on mobile viewport
